~ start
John: [[Greetings!|Zdraztvitķe!|Labas Dienas!]] You have come to my church.
John: Even though i am the supreme leader, i can afford to spare you some time.
=> selection

~ selection
John: Now, what is it that you came to tell me?
...
- I wish to leave
	John: ... ok.
	$> Global.action=""
- Teach me how to defend myself! [if !Global.combat_unlocked /]

	John: Would you like me to give you a little tutorial of how to do combat?
	...
	- Yea sure man, i would love that. 
		John: So... It seems that you've arrived at the combat tutorial. 
		John: Let me explain everything step by step. 
		John: Imagine... Imagine we had images too, so i could show you how to do this. 
		John: First, imagine an image where the player is shown.
		John: And beneath the player there is a red bar... 
		John: That is your healthbar. 
		John: if it reaches 0, you die. 
		John: In your card, at the bottom of your mental image, are cards. 
		John: You can obtain cards in many ways. 
		John: but mainly by buying them from me!
		John: Each card costs time to play. 
		John: Maybe some cards will cost something else. 
		John: Like health. 
		John: The enemies will also show you what to do. 
		John: If they have a sword above their head, it means they are going to attack.
		John: if they have... I don't know... a shield...
		John: Oh shit, i forgot to explain to you block. 
		John: Block disappears at the start of the turn. 
		John: So you would put on block to shield yourself from an opposing attack. 
		John: And if there is shield on top of an enemy, it means they will be harder to hit. 
		John: Yeah.
		John: And then there's probably some other stuff. 
		John: Basically...
		$> Global.open_link("https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slay_the_Spire")
		John: So that's my tutorial. 
		John: Give me a review on my linkedin.
	- Naw bro, just let me fistfight bigfoot already. 
		John: Now that's my language. Here's the license. 
	$> Global.combat_unlocked=true
	John: have fun out there!
	=> selection
- I've heard you're selling some better cards. [if Global.combat_unlocked /]
	if !Global.movement_flags["Defeated John Politician"]:
		John: Mmm... So you have... 
		John: I've aqquired a couple from a... world beyond this one..
		John: Wouldn't call them quite... Exotic...
		John: But you won't find these ones anywhere else.
	$> Global.transition_to_scene("res://location_scenes/Riga/Church of John/John Shop/shop.tscn")
	=> start
- Do you have a quest for me?
	John: In fact I do. 
	John: Due to an... accident...
	John: There are several... Monsters...
	John: Roaming this city...
	John: If you could... take them out...
	John: I would reward you greatly. 
	John: Capiche?
- I want to go out the back.
	if  ("John Politician" in Global.enemies_defeated):
		John: Alright, you've proven your strength. You may pass off to the greater world. 
		John: Never forget about us, back at home!
		John: And if you are able, bring back the box!
		John: We need that box. 
	else:
		John: First, you must defeat me in combat. 
		John: After that, you'll be able to go to the back of the church. 
		=> selection
- I've defeated a monster. 
	John: Oh cool, what monster?
	What monster
	- Bigfoot [if ("Bigfoot" in Global.enemies_defeated and !Global.john_bounties["Bigfoot"]) /]
		John: Cool, here's 30 dollars
		$> Global.money+=30
		$> Global.john_bounties["Bigfoot"]=true
	- A Chupacabra [if ("Chupacabra" in Global.enemies_defeated and !Global.john_bounties["Chupacabra"]) /]
		John: Cool, here's 12 dollars 
		$> Global.money+=12
		$> Global.john_bounties["Chupacabra"]=true
	- A Mongolian Death Worm  [if ("Mongolian Death Worm" in Global.enemies_defeated and !Global.john_bounties["Mongolian Death Worm"]) /]
		John: Cool, here's 70 dollars 
		$> Global.money+=70
		$> Global.john_bounties["Mongolian Death Worm"]=true
	- Mothman [if ("Mothman" in Global.enemies_defeated and !Global.john_bounties["Mothman"]) /]
		John: Cool, here's 70 dollars 
		$> Global.money+=70
		$> Global.john_bounties["Mothman"]=true
	- A Lesser Angel [if ("Lesser Angel" in Global.enemies_defeated and !Global.john_bounties["Lesser Angel"]) /]
		John: Cool, here's 60 dollars 
		$> Global.money+=60
		$> Global.john_bounties["Lesser Angel"]=true
	- A Greater Angel [if ("Greater Angel" in Global.enemies_defeated and !Global.john_bounties["Greater Angel"]) /]
		John: Cool, here's 350 dollars 
		$> Global.money+=350
		$> Global.john_bounties["Greater Angel"]=true
	- Nevermind apparently I lied.
		John: Do not lie to god, I know when you lie to me.  
	=> selection
- There's only one monster left in this town, and that is you! [if Global.combat_unlocked and !("John Politician" in Global.enemies_defeated) /]
	John: JUNIOR! 
	John: You are courting death!
	$> Global.pre_combat_scene="res://location_scenes/Riga/Church of John/church.tscn"
	$> Global.start_combat(["John Politician"])
=> END

